1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,640
Is this... a breakthrough to Nascent Soul ?

25
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,240
With such momentum,

26
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,880
this person is sure to become strong in the future.

27
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,200
Sect Leader, will this person participate in the ceremony

28
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,800
so we can meet them ?

29
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:29,080
Could it... be an outsider

30
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,960
exploiting this blessed environment to breakthrough ?

31
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,880
They have so many Elders here

32
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,800
and none of them noticed until now ?

33
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:36,880
This is interesting.

34
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,480
Everyone stay calm.

35
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,240
In ten breaths,

36
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:44,560
I will capture this thief alive.

37
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:47,760
Let's see.

38
00:02:54,070 --> 00:02:55,400
Is this your doing ?

39
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,480
All the elders of the Cloud Sky Sect are here.

40
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,360
Whoever he is,

41
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,840
he will die today.

42
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,160
Elder Liu !

43
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,560
Such spiritual energy fluctuations...

44
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,920
He isn't here to chat.

45
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,000
Who is this person ?

46
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:44,240
Wang Lin\NEarly stage Nascent Soul

47
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,000
Junior, who are you ?

48
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,800
Come.

49
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:27,520
Don't wait for the future love,

50
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:34,240
the soul between your eyebrows is already peaceful.

51
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,080
Senior,

52
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:31,360
save me.

53
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,600
She's mine !

54
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,160
Senior !

55
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:42,860
I asked the palm lines of time.

56
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:49,640
Sincerely entrust your love, don't waste time.

57
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:49,280
Wan'er knows that Senior has his own goals.

58
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:52,400
The cultivation path is extremely dangerous

59
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,870
but I hope that if you encounter danger in the future,

60
00:04:54,940 --> 00:04:56,800
this formation can delay it for a moment.

61
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:54,120
I promised in my dreams

62
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:57,920
that from now on no one will block our path.

63
00:04:57,960 --> 00:05:04,130
In the blink of an eye, I will change the world.

64
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,440
Killing Sun Zhenwei is easy.

65
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,480
But we have to wait

66
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:08,400
for my cultivation to be high enough so no one can oppose us

67
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,560
both in the Cloud Sky Sect and in Chu.

68
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,480
Sounds good ?

69
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:16,390
In all these nights of longing for the past,

70
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:20,010
deep in my heart

71
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:22,040
I believed that you and I

72
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:26,120
can cross the line between life and death.

73
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:31,280
We will overcome our doomed fate.

74
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:34,560
The night won't last forever.

75
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,200
Bitch !

76
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,720
Do you believe

77
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:38,280
Do you have a death wish ?

78
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,400
I'll kill you !

79
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:41,160
in the unbreakable reincarnation cycle ?

80
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:47,030
Die.

81
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,600
How dare you !?

82
00:05:57,850 --> 00:06:00,040
Insignificant little newborn Nascent Soul,

83
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,790
you will pay with your life !

84
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,040
Die !

85
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:12,760
After seeing your longing eyes,

86
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:16,620
I want to keep them in my heart

87
00:06:16,650 --> 00:06:18,010
to guard them

88
00:06:18,050 --> 00:06:22,970
from the reincarnation cycle.

89
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:27,760
When I saw your beautiful face

90
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,450
This is my personal affair with the Cloud Sky Sect.

91
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:30,920
If anyone dares to intervene,

92
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:31,080
on our first meeting,

93
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,920
I believed

94
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,270
don't blame me for being ruthless.

95
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,920
If you wish to leave now,

96
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,400
I won't stop you.

97
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,400
Farewell then.

98
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,560
Let's go, quick !

99
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:38,490
that fate will never destroy our vows.

100
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,360
I have contacted the Ancestors,

101
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:45,880
they will be here soon.

102
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,360
Fellow cultivator, this is a misunderstanding.

103
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,040
There is no grudge between us.

104
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:57,600
We have treated Elder Li well.

105
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,880
We didn't know you were related to Elder Li,

106
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,400
hence the arranged marriage.

107
00:07:01,970 --> 00:07:04,000
Now that the misunderstanding has been cleared,

108
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:06,000
we can stop here for now.

109
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,920
What do you think ?

110
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:09,640
Sun Zhenwei abused his father's position

111
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,320
to recklessly kill disciples.

112
00:07:11,550 --> 00:07:14,120
He forced Wan'er to marry him.

113
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,740
You all pretended to be blind,

114
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,920
yet now you plead for mercy ?

115
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,760
Let's drag this fight,

116
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,520
the Ancestors are coming.

117
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,560
This kid,

118
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,200
is dead.

119
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,200
Senior,

120
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:54,120
the Cloud Sky Sect has 5 Late stage Nascent Soul ancestors.

121
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,560
We must leave !

122
00:07:56,030 --> 00:07:57,350
I know...

123
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:02,510
I'm waiting for them to arrive.

124
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:13,880
Junior is acting up in our Cloud Sky Sect ?

125
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,330
Greetings Ancestors.

126
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:18,980
The Sect has lived for thousands of years,

127
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,480
but this is the first time someone dared attack

128
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,640
and kill my Elders.

129
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:23,880
Junior,

130
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,440
you won't have to wait for death !

131
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,760
Chen Bailang\NAncestor of the Cloud Sky Sect\NLate stage Nascent Soul

132
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,480
Wait,

133
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:30,570
Yun Tianzi\NAncestor of the Cloud Sky Sect\NLate Stage Nascent Soul

134
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:30,120
although he's Early stage Nascent Soul,

135
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,920
his artifact is too strange.

136
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,360
He's not an ordinary person.

137
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,880
Open the Cloud Sky Formation,

138
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:38,240
we must kill this demonic cultivator.

139
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,610
The thunder breaks the clouds, the sky becomes your cage.

140
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,320
Die !

141
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:31,760
As expected, the formation can trap his weird artifact.

142
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,240
Liu Fei, you joined the sect late.

143
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,600
You've never seen the Cloud Sky Formation in action.

144
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,400
It's a gift from a higher rank country.

145
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,440
It uses the elements to manipulate space

146
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,960
and trap the enemy.

147
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:48,000
Even a Soul Formation cultivator will be injured if trapped inside.

148
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,120
An Early stage Nascent Soul that relies on an artifact

149
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,400
is surely doomed...

150
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,680
This formation can manipulate space

151
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,310
to neutralize the Ji Realm.

152
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:02,000
He cannot use his lightning artifact anymore,

153
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,440
attack together now !

154
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,600
Senior, be careful !

155
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,840
Ancient God Restriction !

156
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:07,920
Did you say that

157
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,520
I cannot use my artifact anymore ?

158
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,960
Ancestors !

159
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,920
The Ancestors...

160
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:25,920
lost...

161
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:28,880
Who the hell are you ?

162
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:31,440
With your strength,

163
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,920
you must not be doing all this

164
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,200
just for a mere alchemist.

165
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,640
Please tell us your purpose !

166
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,800
I want the Cloud Sky Sect.

167
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,160
If we can catch the girl,

168
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,840
we still have a chance.

169
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:56,880
Looking for death ?

170
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,200
Hand over your Soul Blood

171
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,760
and I'll spare your life.

172
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:16,360
I have cultivated for more than 1300 years

173
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:19,160
and have never given anyone my Soul Blood.

174
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,200
If we fight you together,

175
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,040
you won't escape unharmed.

176
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,040
I'd rather die than be humiliated.

177
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,000
We will bet our lives !

178
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:36,160
Fine, don't blame me for it then.

179
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,000
Is this...

180
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,640
Divine Retribution ?

181
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,320
Even if you join forces,

182
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,120
I wonder

183
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,600
if can you withstand a tribulation ?

184
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,160
Every disciple Foundation Establishment and above,

185
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,400
will hand over their Soul Blood

186
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:03,440
or they will die.

187
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,360
Fine,

188
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,360
disciples Foundation Establishment and above,

189
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:15,920
hand over your Soul Blood.

190
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,520
The Cloud Sky Sect

191
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,160
is changing owners today...

192
00:13:37,890 --> 00:13:38,680
Senior !

193
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,280
What's wrong ?

194
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:45,360
Wan'er, I need you to protect me.

195
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:53,640
Senior,

196
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,540
Your Nascent Soul...

197
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,800
why is it so weak ?

198
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:00,240
I failed to form my Nascent Soul

199
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,880
so I substituted it with my avatar

200
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:05,790
to temporarily gain Nascent Soul power.

201
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,030
Then...

202
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:10,840
Your cultivation will decline.

203
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:14,090
That's why you had to fight the Ancestors immediately ?

204
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:18,560
Senior...

205
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:20,890
Don't worry.

206
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,880
My failure is due to the time limit.

207
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:27,560
Now protect me, I must stabilize my cultivation.

208
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,040
Wan'er,

209
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,560
please make me some pills.

210
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:42,400
10 days later

211
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:52,760
Count the specks of time

212
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:55,960
floating down gently.

213
00:14:56,080 --> 00:15:02,080
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

214
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,520
Senior...

215
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:07,040
Forever lock away the scars

216
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:06,080
Wan'er, we have known each other for many years.

217
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,440
There are some things

218
00:15:07,530 --> 00:15:09,040
that I wish to tell you.

219
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:09,640
of this mortal life.

220
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:16,000
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

221
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,160
I am not from the Burning Fire Country.

222
00:15:15,230 --> 00:15:17,320
I come from a remote country named Zhao.

223
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:19,320
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

224
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,080
that fills the sky

225
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:24,140
with a myriad of colors.

226
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:26,480
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

227
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:31,040
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

228
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,160
I asked the heavens who exactly

229
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,040
Noooo !!!

230
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:35,240
sliced open this world

231
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:38,000
to let the rain fall in.

232
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:40,240
I will refine the world

233
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,680
to make our palm lines say

234
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:45,160
that we will live forever.

235
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:49,280
Are you going to return to Zhao now ?

236
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:51,550
Yes,

237
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,360
because if I don't,

238
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,680
I'm unfilial.

239
00:15:57,050 --> 00:15:58,760
You should come with me as well.

240
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,200
If I come to Zhao...

241
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,600
I will only be a burden.

242
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,560
I want to stay in the Cloud Sky Sect

243
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,560
so that I can improve my alchemy.

244
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:12,560
Only here do I have the right conditions to try to refine grade 6 pills.

245
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,430
That way I can be useful to you in the future.

246
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,560
Chu has many factions,

247
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,840
the Cloud Sky Sect is not safe,

248
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:20,840
you...

249
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:23,720
I have been in the Cloud Sky Sect for a long time

250
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:26,080
so I can take care of these things myself.

251
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:08,600
I will manage the Cloud Sky Sect for my husband.

252
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,800
I hope Seniors will take care of me.

253
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,000
Ancestors,

254
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,860
your status is very noble

255
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:46,760
so please don’t take the matter of the Soul Blood to heart

256
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,280
In 500 years,

257
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:50,120
Wan'er will return it to you.

258
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,400
To apologize,

259
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:55,320
I will make pills that will increase your lifespan

260
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:57,280
and gift them to you.

261
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:00,320
Each pill increases life by 50 years.

262
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:05,040
A pill that increases lifespan !?

263
00:18:05,050 --> 00:18:05,800
Quick,

264
00:18:05,800 --> 00:18:07,000
give it to me !

265
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,680
Did...

266
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:12,920
Did you really make this pill ?

267
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,760
I refined this pill,

268
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:17,120
but the materials were provided by my husband.

269
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,780
Rich spiritual energy...

270
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:21,400
a fragrant smell...

271
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,400
This is at least a grade 5 pill !

272
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:26,640
Elder Li refined this herself ?

273
00:18:26,850 --> 00:18:28,630
I admire you !

274
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,360
You can become the Sect Leader ! I don't mind.

275
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:34,400
Elder Li is very proficient at alchemy.

276
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,520
You taking charge of the Cloud Sky Sect

277
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:39,510
is a blessing in disguise.

278
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,710
Little friend, you gave her our Soul Blood,

279
00:18:43,930 --> 00:18:45,720
you can leave this place safely.

280
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:47,960
You can rest assured,

281
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,360
I will keep her safe for 500 years !

282
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,200
Teng Huayuan...

283
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:13,760
I, Wang Lin,

284
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,720
am coming back.

285
00:19:18,620 --> 00:21:34,590
Wang Lin is pretty chill about his "failed" breakthrough, however it's quite a big deal.\NHere is the sequence of events:\N\N-Wang Lin has a Ji Realm cultivation that he unlocked by accident back when Teng Huayuan killed his parents. This type of cultivation is very strong but no known cultivators (neither alive nor in the ancient records of planet Suzaku) have ever reached a level above Nascent Soul with it.\N\N-Wang Lin reconstructs his original body thanks to the memories of the Ancient God and then goes back to Ma Liang's corpse to retrieve his Golden Core to continue to cultivate. At that point the Ji Realm is both in his soul and his new body.\N\N-After trying to reach Nascent Soul once and understanding that the Ji Realm is preventing him from advancing further, Wang Lin decides to use the Divine Path to create an avatar of himself (which is free from the Ji Realm as he has to cultivate from scratch with a new body) in order to merge with it.\N\N-The avatar cultivates up to the Nascent Soul breakthrough and then when it merges with the original body, the Ji Realm still prevents the Nascent Soul from forming naturally. In order to circumvent this limitation, Wang Lin undergoes the breakthrough only with his avatar, which reaches Nascent Soul without issues, and then puts his Nascent Soul avatar inside his Ancient God body to use its Nascent Soul cultivation instead of the original body's Core Formation cultivation.\N\N-With this convoluted method, Wang Lin is able to use the Ji Realm at Nascent Soul level but with a great cost of spiritual energy. This is only a temporary solution because now Wang Lin is completely stuck and cannot advance his cultivation anymore.

286
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:31,180
I've had my share of wounds,

287
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:31,180
now I want to fight back.

288
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:34,740
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

289
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:40,660
that's blocking all my hopes

290
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:40,660
for life ?

291
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:46,420
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

292
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,420
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

293
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:49,820
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

294
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:55,820
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

295
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:55,820
out of reach.

296
00:19:57,180 --> 00:20:01,300
Immortals

297
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:01,300
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

298
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:05,340
Renegades

299
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:05,340
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

300
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:09,180
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

301
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:09,180
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

302
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:13,300
because I don't see the harm in that.

303
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:21,100
My new body opens its eyes

304
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:21,100
and awakens from its dream.

305
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:28,660
I have overcome many trials

306
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:28,660
to get this body back.

307
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:36,300
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

308
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:36,300
I can still see.

309
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:45,660
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

310
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:45,660
by my own hands.

311
00:21:01,100 --> 00:21:07,060
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

312
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:07,060
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

313
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:14,620
With a flick of a finger,

314
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:14,620
only my indomitable heart remains.

315
00:21:14,660 --> 00:21:24,020
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

316
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:24,020
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

317
00:21:24,260 --> 00:21:31,860
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

318
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:31,860
like the descent of a god.
